{"unit_id":"Paimonshen__dsh-coding-plugin#card-zh","repo":"Paimonshen/dsh-coding-plugin","commit":"f0dbd9c0f224a60de94288b36ef7fb32a7ce89b4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-coding-plugin 是面向编程学习者的 DSH Web 悬浮面板，可用 /coding 启用。它提供 Python、JavaScript、TypeScript 和 PowerShell 代码编辑运行、课程关卡自动评判、进度导出、笔记与片段保存，也可把代码发到当前会话请主模型分析。适合在 DSH 中练习编程并记录学习过程；需要 DSH 的 shell、文件系统和沙箱服务，无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["source/host.js:1","src/client/app.js:40-220","package.json:42-44"]}
{"unit_id":"Paimonshen__dsh-coding-plugin#card-en","repo":"Paimonshen/dsh-coding-plugin","commit":"f0dbd9c0f224a60de94288b36ef7fb32a7ce89b4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-coding-plugin adds a floating panel to DSH Web, opened with /coding. It runs four languages, checks course exercises, exports progress, and saves notes and snippets. Send code to the current conversation for analysis. It needs DSH shell and filesystem services; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["source/host.js:1","src/client/app.js:40-220","package.json:42-44"]}
